          paragraph
            text "null"
            text "和"
            text "NaN"
            text "是两种不同的状态："
            text "fill_null(0)"
            text "只替换"
            text "null"
            text "，因此浮点值"
            text "NaN"
            text "仍会留下。把缺失值换成零也会改变均值的分母，不能默认等同于排除它。"
            anchor [ref=675, url=file:///Users/tsk/.local/share/archify-tuning/rounds/2026-10-30-reading-round46/author/answer.html#source-guide]
              text "1"
          ordered_list
            list_item
              text "1"
              text "null"
              text "表示缺失；"
              text "NaN"
              text "是特殊浮点值，在 Polars 中不算"
              text "null"
              text "。"
              anchor [ref=676, url=file:///Users/tsk/.local/share/archify-tuning/rounds/2026-10-30-reading-round46/author/answer.html#source-defs]
                text "2"
            list_item
              text "2"
              text "此例中均值跳过"
              text "null"
              text "，但"
              text "NaN"
              text "会传播；换成零则把零纳入均值。"
              anchor [ref=677, url=file:///Users/tsk/.local/share/archify-tuning/rounds/2026-10-30-reading-round46/author/answer.html#source-guide]
                text "1"
